            "text": "theorem jet_regularInverse_zero (I : Window) {ε : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (r : ℕ) (hr : 1 ≤ r)\n    (A : AxisSpace I ε) (m : ℕ) {x : ℝ} (hx : x ∈ I.interval) :\n    inputJet I ε (regularInverse I hε r hr A) 0 m x = 0"
